            ></span
          >
        </h1>
        <p class="v58-lead">
          You know the role - open too long, the resumes you can't get through. We take it off you and send three worth
          the interview - found by us, or from your own pipeline. Your team focuses on the interviews.
        </p>
        <div class="v58-actions">
          <a href="/contact" data-form-intent="role" data-form-source="v58-hero" class="v58-primary"
            >Start with one role</a
          ><a href="#proof" class="v58-link">Move the bar yourself <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="v58-micro"><i></i> First shortlist in <b data-v58-count="36">36</b> hours</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="v58-hero-c__cue" href="#proof"
      ><span>It&rsquo;s live &mdash; move the bar</span><svg viewBox="0 0 18 22" aria-hidden="true"
        ><path d="M9,2 L9,15"></path><path d="M3.5,10 L9,16.5 L14.5,10"></path></svg
      ></a
    >
  </header>

  <div class="v58-logo-strip">
