  <section class="v58-section v58-thesis" id="what">
    <div class="v58-wrap v58-two">
      <div>
        <p class="v58-kicker"><span>\</span> What this is</p><h2>
          Three candidates.<br />Each has cleared your bar.
        </h2><p class="v58-thesis__body">
          A resume tells you who applied. Finding out who can do the job takes interviews, round after round. We do that
          work first, screening and interviewing against the bar your hiring manager sets. You meet three candidates,
          each with evidence behind every score.
        </p><p class="v58-thesis__claim"><span>Three worth meeting.</span> <span>The proof to choose.</span></p>
      </div><figure class="v58-barcard">
        <span>One bar · every candidate</span><svg
          viewBox="0 0 530 190"
          role="img"
          aria-label="One bar. Eight candidates measured the same way. Three clear it."
          ><path
            d="M28,96 Q150,92 275,95 T502,93.5"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"></path><text x="502" y="82" text-anchor="end">YOUR BAR</text><g
            stroke="#E4E3DE"
            stroke-width="1.4"
            ><line x1="62" y1="95" x2="62" y2="132"></line><line x1="120" y1="95" x2="120" y2="132"></line><line
              x1="178"
              y1="61"
              x2="178"
              y2="95"></line><line x1="236" y1="95" x2="236" y2="132"></line><line x1="294" y1="61" x2="294" y2="95"
            ></line><line x1="352" y1="95" x2="352" y2="132"></line><line x1="410" y1="61" x2="410" y2="95"></line><line
              x1="468"
              y1="95"
              x2="468"
              y2="132"></line></g
          ><g fill="none" stroke="#DA0007" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
            ><path d="M167,27 Q171,32 175,36 Q184,23 192,11"></path><path d="M283,28 Q287,32 291,36 Q300,22 308,12"
            ></path><path d="M399,26 Q404,33 407,36 Q416,24 423,11"></path></g
          ><g
            >{
              [
                [54, 132, '#CFCEC9'],
                [112, 132, '#CFCEC9'],
                [169, 43, '#DA0007'],
                [228, 132, '#CFCEC9'],
                [285, 43, '#DA0007'],
                [344, 132, '#CFCEC9'],
                [401, 43, '#DA0007'],
                [460, 132, '#CFCEC9'],
